{
 "batchId": "b-0311",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_5e1fcd8ca3f3895e789a",
   "sourceHash": "5e1fcd8ca3f3895e789a452c466e1171607f0202dbb818f62a9e2cc9eaf27055",
   "text": "树下草地上的集体瑜伽课，学员双臂舒展",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7c648fea9050f5e5c608",
   "sourceHash": "7c648fea9050f5e5c608609cca4a1bd7e8c4871bf7fc258e8cd8b0bd1baf9f94",
   "text": "瑜伽静修计划是一段带来转变的时光，个人或团体暂时离开日常生活，深入……",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'transformative getaway' rendered as 带来转变的时光 to avoid holiday/getaway framing; 'retreat' rendered as 静修计划 (programme)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_eec114dc0be1e541e6ab",
   "sourceHash": "eec114dc0be1e541e6ab38a1ce2a682557c7640a9897a910df2578fd75edb716",
   "text": "一位身穿绿衣的女士在明亮的大厅里双臂上举，做低弓步练习",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9154f4b22bcc927d0e23",
   "sourceHash": "9154f4b22bcc927d0e23309d35c48ed20906cb2b52b691c4940da405b97108e1",
   "text": "在Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村，我们致力于为尊敬的患者与来访者提供沉浸式的…..",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'esteemed guests' rendered as 尊敬的患者与来访者 (patients and visitors) per the banned-word rule."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_948c5c0f40fbbcd70cbe",
   "sourceHash": "948c5c0f40fbbcd70cbe49bbf2b5c1e64f2cad67044b456c87b14f1558724e84",
   "text": "一位身穿米色长袍的女士站在热带花园中的木制拱桥上",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f40e660f0875e909b27e",
   "sourceHash": "f40e660f0875e909b27ee66d76ff89244459acfa99b041514f9e847ea140c197",
   "text": "戒瘾与康复治疗项目",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_efb687ec1370d661dfe6",
   "sourceHash": "efb687ec1370d661dfe6fb6042aec776588ed9f1fa11564281239ca78bf4a0ab",
   "text": "阿育吠陀提供古老的疗法，帮助戒除酒精和烟草成瘾，促进整体…",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4ea25275bcbc5e943f7f",
   "sourceHash": "4ea25275bcbc5e943f7f9dba26e24ca5023d4d58fa6cedecad9f5dd3fbc39ed8",
   "text": "在Nasya（鼻腔疗法）过程中，一位理疗师用金属器皿将药油滴入患者鼻孔",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3199989bb4637b602821",
   "sourceHash": "3199989bb4637b6028210cc639872c4600875443ef6ce7cf2ce9f56f55db2e35",
   "text": "鼻窦炎和偏头痛是当今常见的病症。鼻窦炎指鼻窦发炎，而偏头痛则会带来急性….",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_99267fc5e40264e70ba0",
   "sourceHash": "99267fc5e40264e70ba0290a4c2a47d258b10508ff1a7f1f046868c288eca31c",
   "text": "治疗过程中，涂有药油的双手为患者按摩面部和颈部",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_86bd4dcc65e8fd77656b",
   "sourceHash": "86bd4dcc65e8fd77656bff102a4f8f97dac8b776119943dd9aff7310c1d09cf3",
   "text": "进行Netra Tarpana眼部治疗时，在患者闭合的双眼周围塑成面团圈",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bb049d7c99911b82c1e2",
   "sourceHash": "bb049d7c99911b82c1e2723784d305c23cbff0dc769aa4516ba0f23bcf1098a1",
   "text": "眼部护理治疗项目",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c2015b64368282944e3f",
   "sourceHash": "c2015b64368282944e3f30f5a2b7f9433a9507c9c90c998b0265c5f2bffc6bad",
   "text": "视力的重要性往往在开始失去时才会被真正感受到。因此需要对深层…..加以关注",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_723aa0a6efe95771a6c5",
   "sourceHash": "723aa0a6efe95771a6c5fb3fd0c5f2041b925500955bed6636d8a469af917448",
   "text": "一位身穿灰色衬衫的女士闭着眼睛，痛苦地按住额头",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_93e18cef425332628698",
   "sourceHash": "93e18cef425332628698b4b0a5c0c986fa18644e2247d81853dcb925e599adb5",
   "text": "缓解压力与劳损的治疗项目",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Remove' rendered as 缓解 (relieve) to avoid an absolute claim."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0d021236c1b5a64e9945",
   "sourceHash": "0d021236c1b5a64e9945fbcdb8ac2696f13f4daf60ec05af6e1fe678a0fe1fc4",
   "text": "压力通常源于三德（gunas：rajas、tamas与sattva）的失衡，可能严重扰乱我们的生活。由于sattva……",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a6797d3579ad344ebf08",
   "sourceHash": "a6797d3579ad344ebf08fb4717de13af868ea11da58aa8ea298e99d7f102c4b0",
   "text": "标有“HYPERTENSION（高血压）”的插图：红色心脏、心电图曲线以及刻度为140至300的血压计",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ddfdd2db45016febd90b",
   "sourceHash": "ddfdd2db45016febd90b4585111a052fc51a123feeba4ea634932815e29dde51",
   "text": "高血压会带来心脏病发作、中风等严重的健康风险。生活方式因素…..",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9cb5a4d66faa0d835610",
   "sourceHash": "9cb5a4d66faa0d835610d369e80ba3f87f3aa5bf7c82216de752331688f87d16",
   "text": "一位护理人员跪下为轮椅上的人系鞋",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1275ea59ae8e58a279b9",
   "sourceHash": "1275ea59ae8e58a279b9f515c25bcc74aa37be705dfe7ce9967862dba572698a",
   "text": "大脑支配着我们的行为、器官、思维等，至关重要。其结构一旦出现紊乱…..",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2ccb20f2ed442b31194a",
   "sourceHash": "2ccb20f2ed442b31194a5a74590a1fa600274f9c4a248245df4c5c1d97e222a6",
   "text": "两位理疗师为躺在木制治疗床上的患者进行同步药油按摩",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fce97a8d0870a91e4b25",
   "sourceHash": "fce97a8d0870a91e4b25f7601b6ed46b0e7bb1beb90bb2db63ec2c9858f87406",
   "text": "焕活与强健",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5656fd88c76bfc27346e",
   "sourceHash": "5656fd88c76bfc27346e6f68f065a0ca9de0b63ea69db69afe5e03d938e8604a",
   "text": "四只理疗师的手在患者裸露的背部涂抹草药粉",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
